{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Known World and lead one of four asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, fight, build and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the RTS genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clash on Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategies in single-player against the AI or try your luck against other players in multiplayer. Switch Commander, units, abilities and artifacts after every match to find your preferred playstyle, there are endless combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Eternity itself to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelite campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Timefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zones of the map will be progressively locked down and you will have to fight for what little resources and space is left. Will you position yourself strategically to defend to the last or will you build up your army and economy to raze everything in your path?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base, Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic RTS mechanics such as base-building and resource gathering but with a modern take. Grow your economy, compete for resources and outpace your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, we will promote it for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1758285833","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3328840?t=1758285833","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/36d06f85ba44b08983d0904feba2d553be52bac4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758285833","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/36d06f85ba44b08983d0904feba2d553be52bac4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758285833","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the Known World and lead one of four asymmetric races to vanquish your enemies and push back the Timefront. Recruit, fight, build and expand your territory in this thrilling new take on the RTS genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clash on Epic Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/b24f2f48ff8dd32c72b6bc63f0fdc0bd.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strategies in single-player against the AI or try your luck against other players in multiplayer. Switch Commander, units, abilities and artifacts after every match to find your preferred playstyle, there are endless combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/062eed9e2703cf4c0dcc0b9dd7addd63.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich, character-driven story and fight back against Eternity itself to reclaim the lands lost to the Timefront. This roguelite campaign will ensure replayability is fresh and engaging in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Timefront</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/64e19fa51f755d3ebb0b68e9cd337942.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zones of the map will be progressively locked down and you will have to fight for what little resources and space is left. Will you position yourself strategically to defend to the last or will you build up your army and economy to raze everything in your path?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Base, Gather Resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/7eae8fbcba3830c5d23fad4a3d3c476f.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic RTS mechanics such as base-building and resource gathering but with a modern take. Grow your economy, compete for resources and outpace your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.poster.avif?t=1758285833\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.webm?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/extras/668742e0e3c0a5ad31559565ba1f8c9e.mp4?t=1758285833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Worldshaper, Timefront's game editor, to build your own custom games and publish them. If they become popular with the community, we will promote it for you!</p>","developers":["Flama Craftworks"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328840/f839eeb1999044ae469c236129427a31256ca4f3/header.jpg?t=1758285833","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Flama Craftworks. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328840/922060227/2d3b766b29a8e779ec55e59b93d1339d8425ddcf/1758249773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758277894","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328840/922060227/2d3b766b29a8e779ec55e59b93d1339d8425ddcf/1758249773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758277894","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3328840/922060227/2d3b766b29a8e779ec55e59b93d1339d8425ddcf/1758249773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1